ils.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Current injury is a pathologic fracture\n2. Sustained bilateral tibia fracture\n3. Sustained comminuted femur fracture\n4. Sustained severe Traumatic Brain Injury (GCS<12) ***\n5. Sustained severe spinal cord injury (lower extremity paresis/paralysis)\n6. Sustained severe burns (>10% total body surface area (TBSA) or >5% TBSA with full thickness or circumferential injury)\n7. Prior ipsilateral leg injury requiring surgery\n8. Prior or current lower limb deformity or abnormality\n9. Unable to complete follow-up visits\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "AND": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "AND": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "AND": {\n                                "left": {\n                                  "OR": {\n                                    "left": {\n                                      "raw_text": "1. Current injury is a pathologic fracture",\n                                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                        "Current"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation": [\n                                        "injury"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "pathologic fracture",\n                                        "fracture"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                                        "Current"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Observation-Name": [\n                                        "injury"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "pathologic fracture",\n                                        "fracture"\n                                      ]\n                                    },\n                                    "right": {\n                                      "raw_text": "2. Sustained bilateral tibia fracture",\n                                      "Condition": [\n                                        "fracture"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Condition-Name": [\n                                        "fracture"\n                                      ],\n                                      "Modifier": [\n                                        "bilateral tibia"\n                                      ]\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                },\n                                "right": {\n                                  "raw_text": "3. Sustained comminuted femur fracture",\n                                  "Condition": [\n                                    "fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Condition-Name": [\n                                    "fracture"\n                                  ],\n                                  "Modifier": [\n                                    "comminuted femur"\n                                  ]\n                                }\n                              }\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "4. Sustained severe Traumatic Brain Injury (GCS<12) ***",\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "GCS",\n                                "Traumatic Brain Injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                "<12"\n                              ],\n                              "Severity": [\n                                "severe"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "GCS",\n                                "Traumatic Brain Injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                "<"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Value": [\n                                "12"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "5. Sustained severe spinal cord injury (lower extremity paresis/",\n                              "Severity": [\n                                "severe"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "spinal cord injury",\n                                "lower extremity paresis"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "spinal cord injury",\n                                "lower extremity paresis"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "paralysis)",\n                              "Condition": [\n                                "paralysis"\n                              ],\n                              "Condition-Name": [\n                                "paralysis"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "6. Sustained severe burns (>10% total body surface area (TBSA)",\n                          "Severity": [\n                            "severe"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "burns"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            ">10%"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "burns"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Operator": [\n                            ">"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Value": [\n                            "10"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Unit": [\n                            "%"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "TBSA"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "TBSA"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "OR": {\n                            "left": {\n                              "raw_text": "or >5% TBSA with full thickness",\n                              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                                ">5%"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Unit": [\n                                "%"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "TBSA"\n                              ],\n                              "Eq-Operator": [\n                                ">"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "TBSA"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "full thickness"\n                              ]\n                            },\n                            "right": {\n                              "raw_text": "or circumferential injury)",\n                              "Observation": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Observation-Name": [\n                                "injury"\n                              ],\n                              "Modifier": [\n                                "circumferential"\n                              ]\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "7. Prior ipsilateral leg injury requiring surgery",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Prior"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                    "Prior"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "injury"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Procedure-Name": [\n                    "surgery"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "ipsilateral leg"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "8. Prior",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "Prior"\n                  ]\n                },\