occurring within 2 weeks and were confirmed by CT or MRI,\n-  has no history of depression or use of antidepressants or antipsychotics,\n-  were competent to consent to take part in this research.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- diagnosed with the first ever acute ischemic stroke occurring within 2 weeks and were confirmed by CT",\n              "Eq-Operator": [\n                "within"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                "weeks"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Value": [\n                "2"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "within 2 weeks",\n                "first ever"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "ischemic stroke"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "ischemic stroke"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Recency": [\n                "first ever"\n              ],\n              "Procedure": [\n                "CT"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "CT"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or MRI,",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "MRI"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "MRI"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- has"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "no history of depression",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "history"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "history"\n                      ],\n               